{
 "title": "Running the Slide List: Send, Select, Keys and Layers — LayerCue from Zero, Episode 6",
 "version": 1,
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "chapter": "Send or select",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Welcome back! Today, we run a whole presentation, live.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "One rule runs the show: a click on the picture is a send.",
     "pause": 0.8,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Click the name under it instead, and it only loads into Slide settings.",
     "pause": 1.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Nothing goes out. So you can set up the next slide while one is live.",
     "pause": 0.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "chapter": "The keys",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The right arrow sends the next slide. The left arrow, the one before.",
     "pause": 1.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Careful: the arrows send as they go.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "To look without sending, hold Option with the arrows. On Windows, Alt.",
     "pause": 2.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Then press Return to send the one you've chosen.",
     "pause": 1.2,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "chapter": "Seven layers",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Everything on stage sits on seven layers.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Five overlays on top. Then the foreground, F. Then the background, B.",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "A slide goes to the foreground unless you choose.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Where a slide draws nothing, you see the layers below it.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "chapter": "The layer chip",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The chip at the top right of a card picks the layer.",
     "pause": 0.8,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Click it, and the foreground turns into the background.",
     "pause": 1.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Now the video plays on B, and the text sits on top, on F.",
     "pause": 1.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Press and hold the chip, and it goes to overlay one.",
     "pause": 1.8,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "chapter": "Overlays",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "One slide per overlay.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Send another slide to the same overlay, and it replaces the first.",
     "pause": 2.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Different overlays stack. Both stay up together.",
     "pause": 2.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Changing a chip never moves what's already on stage.",
     "pause": 1.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "chapter": "Following the orange",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Learn the orange trail.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The card border. The bar in the sidebar.",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The lit cells in the layer column.",
     "pause": 0.8,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "And the status bar names what's on stage.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "chapter": "One layer at a time",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The control row works on one layer: the cell with the white outline.",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Click another lit cell to switch to it.",
     "pause": 1.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Pause, speed and volume here are for this moment only.",
     "pause": 1.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The red square takes down only this layer's video.",
     "pause": 1.8,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "chapter": "Lock editing",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Before a show, press the pencil. It becomes a padlock.",
     "pause": 1.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Now the list can't change. Sending still works.",
     "pause": 2.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The lock doesn't cover the sidebar. Leave it alone during the show.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Press the padlock again to unlock.",
     "pause": 1.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "chapter": "What's next",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "You can now run a presentation live, layers and all.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Next time: slide settings, to fit, trim and loop.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}